OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand light winds during the evening
OL,7,Fwill allow for widespread fog to form
OL,8,Fovernight as temperatures drop into
OL,9,Fthe single figures. Some of this fog
OL,10,Fmay be dense.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FFog affecting many areas
OL,13,Fduring the morning. Remaining mostly
OL,14,Fdull. Thickening cloud spreading from
OL,15,Fthe northwest will bring a band of
OL,16,Fdrizzly rain later in the afternoon.
OL,17,FThis clearing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
