OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA mix
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and cloudy periods,
OL,7,Fwith showers possible at times.
OL,8,FGenerally light winds. Temperatures
OL,9,Fnear or a little below average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
